// Reference values for the Comunica.gov.ao rebrand. NOT wired into the build
// via baseConfigurationReference: two attempts (project-level, and later a
// per-target wrapper that also #included the CocoaPods xcconfig) proved
// unreliable on Xcode 26.6/"Swift Build" — xcodebuild -showBuildSettings
// resolved the values correctly on one run and silently dropped them (along
// with the target's own CocoaPods PODS_ROOT etc.) on a later run, with no
// error, for the exact same scheme/config and no changes in between. Given
// that, the values below are set as literal strings directly wherever they're
// needed instead — same mechanism upstream already used for
// PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER, just our value, and it actually works reliably.
//
// Kept here as the single documented source of truth; keep it in sync by hand
// with:
//  - project.pbxproj: PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER of NextcloudTalk, ShareExtension,
//    NotificationServiceExtension, BroadcastUploadExtension, TalkIntents
//  - *.entitlements: com.apple.security.application-groups
//  - NextcloudTalk/Settings/NCAppBranding.m: bundleIdentifier / groupIdentifier

PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER_BASE = ao.gov.comunica.talk
APP_GROUP_IDENTIFIER = group.ao.gov.comunica.talk
